OL,3,AHealey unveils #100 for energy bills
OL,4,Aand bank tax in first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of households will get #100 to
OL,7,Fhelp with soaring energy bills to be
OL,8,Fpaid for by a tax on bank profits, John
OL,9,FHealey has announced in his first
OL,10,FBudget.
OL,12,FThe chancellor said he wanted to give
OL,13,Fhard-pressed families "breathing space
OL,14,Fnow" and "hope for the future" as the
OL,15,FUK economy is battered by "global
OL,16,Feconomic storms".
OL,18,FHe also unveiled tax breaks to boost
OL,19,Fhigh street businesses - but confirmed
OL,20,Fthat many big decisions, including on
OL,21,Fdefence spending and welfare, will not
OL,22,Fbe made until next year.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
